               would momentarily match itself and flash "you already logged this". Suppress the hint mid-save —
               including while pinning (the rule auto-files matching rows, which briefly self-matches too).
               ★ One line now, and the dismissal outlives the page (see DismissDupRow). It used to restate the
               amount the row is already showing and the fund it was paid from, then forget the answer on reload —
