    /// <summary>Put the cursor in the Amount field once, after the modal that owns it has rendered. Guarded on the
    /// modal being open because the component only exists while it is; the try/catch covers the render-timing case
    /// where the element is not attached yet (a missed focus must never break the modal).</summary>
