    /// selects into the expense form's field, restores its category/fund picks around the refetch, and applies the
    /// F2 tag→category binding — all of which belong to a form that rewrites the whole expense. Here the tag is the
    /// only thing that may move, and a new tag is never a trip label (there is no trip in this modal).</summary>
    private Task AddTagFromTagOnly() => RunModal(async () =>
